 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Meanwhile, Samsonov arrives at Arkady's luxury hotel room to seek political and psychological advice. Arkady explains the famous five stages of accepting the inevitable and devises a cunning scheme. To shatter Nina's complacency, Arkady suggests sending her a fake court summons for divorce. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Итак, смотри, Самсонов.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Существует пять стадий принятия неизбежного.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Отрицание, гнев, торги, депрессия, смирение.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я ничего не понял.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Твоя жена считает, что ты никому не нужен.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Вот она именно так и считает!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Мы зародим в ней сомнения.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Потом вызовем ревность.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Мы отправим ей повестку в суд!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Как будто ты подаёшь на развод.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я не хочу настоящего развода!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Повестка будет липовая, из принтера.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Не знаю, я очень сомневаюсь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Поздравляю тебя, Самсонов, ты подкаблучник!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let's examine Arkady's divorce summons scheme line by line. Arkady lectures Samsonov on human psychology.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Итак, смотри, Самсонов.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'So, look here, Samsonov.' Arkady begins to explain the strategic plan.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Существует пять стадий принятия неизбежного.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'There are five stages of accepting the inevitable.' The verb takes the 'of' form with the numeral five.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Отрицание, гнев, торги, депрессия, смирение.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Denial, anger, bargaining, depression, acceptance.' A rapid list of five psychological nouns.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я ничего не понял.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I didn't understand anything.' Samsonov admits his bewilderment with a negative pronoun.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Твоя жена считает, что ты никому не нужен.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Your wife thinks nobody needs you.' The second half of the sentence uses the conjunction for 'that'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Вот она именно так и считает!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That is exactly what she thinks!' Samsonov confirms Nina's dismissive attitude.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Мы зародим в ней сомнения.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We will plant doubts in her.' This phrase describes planting an idea.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Потом вызовем ревность.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Then we will provoke jealousy.' The future verb combines.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Мы отправим ей повестку в суд!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We will send her a court summons!' Arkady introduces the central mechanism of his plan.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Как будто ты подаёшь на развод.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'As if you are filing for divorce.' The comparative conjunction introduces an imaginary condition.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я не хочу настоящего развода!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I do not want a real divorce!' Samsonov panics at the thought of actual separation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Повестка будет липовая, из принтера.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The summons will be fake, from a printer.' Arkady reassures him with a colloquial adjective for counterfeit.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Не знаю, я очень сомневаюсь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I don't know, I really doubt it.' Samsonov expresses hesitation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Поздравляю тебя, Самсонов, ты подкаблучник!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I congratulate you, Samsonov, you are henpecked!' Arkady mocks Samsonov's lack of resolve. Now let's listen to Arkady's psychological strategy session one more time without interruption.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
